+# `clippy::unwrap_used` / `clippy::expect_used` are enabled (as `deny`) at
+# module scope in `core/mod.rs` (and `ipc/mod.rs`, once that module exists —
+# AGENTS.md invariant 6 names both). These two options are what makes "outside
+# tests" true rather than aspirational: without them, both lints fire inside
